  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "1 Thessalonians",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 5,
    "summary": "The Saints will know the season of the Second Coming of Christ—Live the way Saints should live—Rejoice evermore—Do not despise prophesyings.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "But of the times and the seasons, brethren, ye have no need that I write unto you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For yourselves know perfectly that the day of the Lord so cometh as a thief in the night.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 42,
            "text": "TG Day of the Lord; Millennium, Preparing a People for."
          },
          {
            "start": 70,
            "end": 75,
            "text": "D&C 106:4."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For when they shall say, Peace and safety; then sudden destruction cometh upon them, as travail upon a woman with child; and they shall not escape.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 41,
            "text": "TG Refuge."
          },
          {
            "start": 140,
            "end": 146,
            "text": "D&C 1:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "But ye, brethren, are not in darkness, that that day should overtake you as a thief.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "Rom. 13:12 (12–13)."
          },
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 52,
            "text": "Luke 17:24; 21:34."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Ye are all the children of light, and the children of the day: we are not of the night, nor of darkness.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 23,
            "text": "GR sons. TG Children of Light."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore let us not sleep, as do others; but let us watch and be sober.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 26,
            "text": "TG Sleep."
          },
          {
            "start": 53,
            "end": 58,
            "text": "TG Watch."
          },
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 71,
            "text": "GR sober, vigilant, circumspect. TG Abstain."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 33
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For they that sleep sleep in the night; and they that be drunken are drunken in the night.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "But let us, who are of the day, be sober, putting on the breastplate of faith and love; and for an helmet, the hope of salvation.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "TG Levity."
          },
          {
            "start": 57,
            "end": 68,
            "text": "Rom. 13:12; Eph. 6:11 (11–18)."
          },
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 77,
            "text": "Col. 1:4 (4–5); 1 Thes. 1:3."
          },
          {
            "start": 111,
            "end": 115,
            "text": "TG Hope."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For God hath not appointed us to wrath, but to obtain salvation by our Lord Jesus Christ,",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 38,
            "text": "1 Thes. 1:10; 1 Pet. 2:8 (6–8)."
          },
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 63,
            "text": "TG Salvation."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Who died for us, that, whether we wake or sleep, we should live together with him.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 63,
            "text": "TG Immortality."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Wherefore comfort yourselves together, and edify one another, even as also ye do.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 17,
            "text": "GR exhort, console, encourage."
          },
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "TG Edification."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "And we beseech you, brethren, to know them which labour among you, and are over you in the Lord, and admonish you;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 55,
            "text": "TG Leadership."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "And to esteem them very highly in love for their work’s sake. And be at peace among yourselves.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 13,
            "text": "Philip. 2:29. TG Respect."
          },
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 77,
            "text": "Mark 9:50; Rom. 15:5 (1–7); D&C 20:54 (53–55)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 62,
            "end": 65
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Now we exhort you, brethren, warn them that are unruly, comfort the feebleminded, support the weak, be patient toward all men.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "TG Warn."
          },
          {
            "start": 48,
            "end": 54,
            "text": "2 Thes. 3:11."
          },
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 63,
            "text": "GR encourage, console."
          },
          {
            "start": 68,
            "end": 80,
            "text": "GR faint-hearted, despondent."
          },
          {
            "start": 82,
            "end": 89,
            "text": "GR care for."
          },
          {
            "start": 94,
            "end": 98,
            "text": "GR infirm, doubting, timid."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 122,
            "end": 126
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "See that none render evil for evil unto any man; but ever follow that which is good, both among yourselves, and to all men.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 20,
            "text": "TG Retribution."
          },
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "TG Forbear."
          },
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 47,
            "text": "TG Enemies."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 47
          },
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 48
          },
          {
            "start": 119,
            "end": 123
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Rejoice evermore.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 7,
            "text": "TG Joy."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Pray without ceasing.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4,
            "text": "TG Prayer."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "In every thing give thanks: for this is the will of God in Christ Jesus concerning you.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 26,
            "text": "TG Communication; Thanksgiving."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Quench not the Spirit.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 6,
            "text": "GR Extinguish, Hinder, Suppress."
          },
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "TG Holy Ghost, Gifts of; Holy Ghost, Loss of."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Despise not prophesyings.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Prove all things; hold fast that which is good.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5,
            "text": "GR Examine, Put to the test. 1 Jn. 4:1 (1–6). TG Study; Test."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Abstain from all appearance of evil.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 7,
            "text": "TG Abstain."
          },
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "GR kinds. TG Apparel."
          },
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "TG Evil."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "And the very God of peace sanctify you wholly; and I pray God your whole spirit and soul and body be preserved blameless unto the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 34,
            "text": "TG Sanctification."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 61
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Faithful is he that calleth you, who also will do it.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 11
          },
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 53
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Brethren, pray for us.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Greet all the brethren with an holy kiss.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "JST 1 Thes. 5:26 … salutation."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I charge you by the Lord that this epistle be read unto all the holy brethren.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you. Amen.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 37
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
